<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on registered shares of CS Holding.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    177 CHF		   PREMIUM	16.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.20 CHF		  GEARING	13.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.MAR.97-15.OCT.98   PAYDATE	26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     SPOT REF     162.75 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
